
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Моё небо ☁️</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  height: 100vh;
  background: linear-gradient(
    180deg, #6599df 0%, #b3d2f4 60%, #f8d9e4 100%
  );
}

.sky {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.sun {
  position: absolute;
  top: 13%;
  right: 17%;
  width: 75px;
  height: 75px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff1c4;
  box-shadow: 0 0 70px 25px #ffe9bf66;
}

.cloud {
  position: absolute;
  left: -300px;
  width: 180px;
  height: 55px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  background: #fffaf6;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 12px #597fb322);
  animation: float linear infinite;
}

.cloud::before,
.cloud::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  background: inherit;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.cloud::before {
  width: 85px;
  height: 85px;
  left: 25px;
  bottom: 15px;
}

.cloud::after {
  width: 105px;
  height: 105px;
  right: 20px;
  bottom: 5px;
}

.c1 {
  top: 20%;
  transform: scale(.8);
  animation-duration: 38s;
}

.c2 {
  top: 42%;
  transform: scale(1.3);
  animation-duration: 55s;
  animation-delay: -25s;
  opacity: .85;
}

.c3 {
  top: 65%;
  transform: scale(.65);
  animation-duration: 32s;
  animation-delay: -12s;
  opacity: .7;
}

.c4 {
  top: 32%;
  transform: scale(1.05);
  animation-duration: 48s;
  animation-delay: -37s;
  opacity: .9;
}

@keyframes float {
  from { left: -300px; }
  to { left: calc(100% + 300px); }
}

.note {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 30px;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: center;
  color: #fffaf6;
  font: 15px Georgia, serif;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 8px #536eaa55;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sky">
  <div class="sun"></div>
  <div class="cloud c1"></div>
  <div class="cloud c2"></div>
  <div class="cloud c3"></div>
  <div class="cloud c4"></div>
  <div class="note">a little piece of sky</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
 
